	(text_box "latching of watchdog error or MCU inducing an error?\ndo we want / need this?\n\nIMD error sould be latching but IMD is on ESS side\n\nIf we implement both we have the watchdog causing a latching error and the MCU can cause a latched or non latched error p think one should not bee needed, especially if we individually control the N contactors\n\n\nMCU SDC öffner fliegt raus, nur watchdog und latching. Wenn wir kontrolliert abschalten dann macht das der ESS kontroller ansonsten löst der Pack controller einen latching fehler aus"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 378.46 124.46 0)
		(size 43.18 35.56)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
